Define fearlessMessage$send(Message):
A fact The folder at the 'manager path' holds one LockFile called single_manager_at_X.lock
B fact a process holds the lock of single_manager_at_X.lock
C action fearlessMessage connects to the port X
D action print fearlessMessage$send(X,Message)
E action fearlessMessage ends.

Define fearlessMessage$send(Message):
A fact The folder at the 'manager path' holds one LockFile not called single_manager_at_X.lock
B fact a process holds the lock of the LockFile.
B action fearlessMessage waits until A does not hold.
C action fearlessMessage$send(Message)

